@page
@model Web.Pages.AboutModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<div class="container mt-5 mb-5">
    <h2 class="text-center mb-4">About Us</h2>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <h3>Welcome to ShopWebsite!</h3>
            <p>ShopWebsite is your one-stop shop for all your needs. Our mission is to provide high-quality products at affordable prices. We strive to offer a seamless shopping experience with a wide range of products to suit every taste and budget.</p>
            <p>Founded in 2023, ShopWebsite has quickly become a trusted name in the industry. We are committed to delivering excellent customer service and ensuring that every purchase meets your expectations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <h3>Meet the Owner</h3>
            <p>Hi, I'm Shon, the proud owner of ShopWebsite. With a passion for e-commerce and a commitment to customer satisfaction, I started this venture to bring the best products to your doorstep.</p>
            <p>I believe in building strong relationships with our customers and ensuring that every interaction with ShopWebsite is a positive one. Feel free to reach out to me with any questions or feedback. I'm always here to help!</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row mt-4">
        <div class="col-md-12 text-center">
            <h3>Our Mission</h3>
            <p>Our mission is to make shopping easy and enjoyable for everyone. We aim to provide a diverse range of products, excellent customer service, and a hassle-free shopping experience.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
